{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260508/entry_horizontal_69fd7de756e3a93ac7692248_1778221517986_640x360.jpg\"><p>日圓匯價過去一周四度抽升，市場相信是當局出手撐匯價。獨立外匯及商品分析師盧楚仁認為，日圓弱勢難扭轉，每次反彈反而是造淡時機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T08:06:02.578317+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":62,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}